'''Iris''' (Japanese: '''アイリス''' ''Iris'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, if your opponent's Active Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an attack used by your {{TCGP|Haxorus}}, you get 1 more point.
}}

